From: Platina local project
Subject: [PATCH] Rebase unchanged PM660 haptics node after Bluetooth

The previous Bluetooth patch appends nodes after the original sound context.
Keep the haptics setting unchanged and append it after those nodes.
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm660-xiaomi-platina.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm660-xiaomi-platina.dts
@@ -1179,3 +1179,8 @@
 		max-speed = <3200000>;
 	};
 };
+
+/* Vibrator: PM660 SPMI haptics (LRA). Proven on jasmine/whyred/lavender. */
+&pm660_haptics {
+	status = "okay";
+};
